<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx3.SSx1.SSSx3.Px1" title="In C. Effectiveness of Cross-Branch Attention Manipulation ‣ Conditioning Matters: Stabilizing Inversion and Attention in Diffusion Image Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Attention distance.</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
